            "review_text": "Martin F\nZurich111 contributions\n0\nBest vegetarian restaurant in HCM\nNov 2022\nBeautiful place with interesting menu. I eat there almost every day when I am in Saigon. The food is tasty and looks good. Very reasonable prices and helpful staff. Healthy food with rich taste. Great hot pots!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 28, 2022",
